  - title: 
    basic: An Insulin monomer is composed of 2 chains, A and B.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
    basic: Two disulfide bonds connect chain A and B of an insulin monomer together.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
    basic: One disulfide bond creates a kink in chain A.
    intermediate: 
    advanced: 
  - title: 
